flowchart TD
    title Admin Dashboard Flow

    A[Admin Login] --> B{Is Admin?}
    B -->|No| C[Access Denied]
    B -->|Yes| D[Load Dashboard]

    D --> E{Admin Action?}
    E -->|View Users| F[Load User List]
    F --> G[Display Users Table]
    G --> H{User Action?}
    H -->|Edit| I[Load User Form]
    H -->|Deactivate| J[Confirm Deactivation]
    H -->|Back| D

    E -->|Manage Products| K[Load Product List]
    K --> L[Display Products Table]
    L --> M{Product Action?}
    M -->|Edit| N[Load Product Form]
    M -->|Archive| O[Confirm Archive]
    M -->|Add New| P[Empty Product Form]
    M -->|Back| D

    E -->|View Orders| Q[Load Order List]
    Q --> R[Filter by Status]
    R --> S[Display Orders Table]
    S --> T{Order Action?}
    T -->|View Details| U[Load Order Detail]
    T -->|Update Status| V[Status Dropdown]
    T -->|Back| D

    E -->|Analytics| W[Load Analytics]
    W --> X[Revenue Chart]
    W --> Y[Order Trends]
    W --> Z[Top Products]
